     See .danger-group in profile.page.scss for the full explanation.
     `.suggestion` below keeps its 1px: at 999px the radius clamps to half the
     chip's height, so its curve is already shallow and a 2px border would only
     bloat it. */
  border: 2px solid var(--color-border, #dfe4ec);
